    "text": "Getting Started / 08 Your phone is one of the most useful tools available to you. It connects you to many systems and services throughout the city. Take some time to explore its applications. Depending on your phone, you may have access to communication, real estate, jobs, transportation, entertainment and other important services. If you are unsure how to access a system, check your phone first. Many important features are available directly through its applications.",
    "snippet": "Your phone is one of the most useful tools available to you. It connects you to many systems and services throughout the city. Take some time to explore its app"
