    "text": "Career / Media The Oblivion News Network keeps the population informed about what is happening throughout the world. From unusual events to important developments in the city, news staff can investigate stories and bring them to the wider community. Join the News Network Applications are handled through the relevant Discord server. Join the organisation, check its current requirements and submit your application there.",
    "snippet": "The Oblivion News Network keeps the population informed about what is happening throughout the world. From unusual events to important developments in the city,"
